# Used by `vite build` (production mode) so a build with no dashboard
# environment variables still reaches the backend instead of
# http://localhost:3000/api/v1. A Render/CI VITE_API_URL overrides this.
#
# A path, not a host: the browser calls this site's own /api/v1/..., and the host serving the
# site forwards /api/* to the backend (the rewrite rule in render.yaml / the Render dashboard).
# That keeps the backend's address out of the bundle and out of the browser's Network tab.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
